      "updated": 1762086994498,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Statement vs PreparedStatement vs CallableStatement\n1. Statement\njava\n\nStatement stmt = conn.createStatement();\nString sql = \"SELECT * FROM users WHERE age > 25\";\nResultSet rs = stmt.executeQuery(sql);\n\n❌ Vulnerable to SQL injection\n❌ Slower (no pre-compilation)\n✅ Good for static queries\n\n2. PreparedStatement ⭐ (Recommended)\njava\n\n\nPreparedStatement pstmt = conn.prepareStatement(\"SELECT * FROM users WHERE age > ?\");\npstmt.setInt(1, 25);\nResultSet rs = pstmt.executeQuery();\n\n✅ Prevents SQL injection\n✅ Faster (pre-compiled)\n✅ Good for dynamic queries\n✅ Reusable\n\n3. CallableStatement\njava\n\nCallableStatement cstmt = conn.prepareCall(\"{call getUsersByAge(?)}\");\ncstmt.setInt(1, 25);\nResultSet rs = cstmt.executeQuery();\n\n✅ For stored procedures\n✅ Can handle IN/OUT parameters",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Statement vs PreparedStatement vs CallableStatement\n1. Statement\njava\n\nStatement stmt = conn.createStatement();\nString sql = \"SELECT * FROM users WHERE age > 25\";\nResultSet rs = stmt.executeQuery(sql);\n\n❌ Vulnerable to SQL injection\n❌ Slower (no pre-compilation)\n✅ Good for static queries\n\n2. PreparedStatement ⭐ (Recommended)\njava\n\n\nPreparedStatement pstmt = conn.prepareStatement(\"SELECT * FROM users WHERE age > ?\");\npstmt.setInt(1, 25);\nResultSet rs = pstmt.executeQuery();\n\n✅ Prevents SQL injection\n✅ Faster (pre-compiled)\n✅ Good for dynamic queries\n✅ Reusable\n\n3. CallableStatement\njava\n\nCallableStatement cstmt = conn.prepareCall(\"{call getUsersByAge(?)}\");\ncstmt.setInt(1, 25);\nResultSet rs = cstmt.executeQuery();\n\n✅ For stored procedures\n✅ Can handle IN/OUT parameters",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QCiO8Suit6jV4Lj8QHKzr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -312.8015725862161,
      "y": 12616.83304348708,
      "width": 970.1995849609375,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFk",
