      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Configuration\nDefinition\nType: org.hibernate.cfg.Configuration (Class)\nPurpose: Loads Hibernate configuration and builds SessionFactory\nCommunication: Reads settings → Creates SessionFactory\nWhat is it?\nConfiguration is a class that:\n\nReads hibernate.cfg.xml or programmatic settings\nLoads entity mappings\nBuilds the SessionFactory interface\nActs as a bootstrap for Hibernate\n\nCode Examples",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Configuration\nDefinition\nType: org.hibernate.cfg.Configuration (Class)\nPurpose: Loads Hibernate configuration and builds SessionFactory\nCommunication: Reads settings → Creates SessionFactory\nWhat is it?\nConfiguration is a class that:\n\nReads hibernate.cfg.xml or programmatic settings\nLoads entity mappings\nBuilds the SessionFactory interface\nActs as a bootstrap for Hibernate\n\nCode Examples",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "1pXb1lWOwhw1D24lfvxfz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -285.8378531713639,
      "y": 18999.947835637024,
      "width": 605,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
