    {
      "id": "RG7fXgex11xZ9MOzykPq-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -460.6359107002383,
      "y": 22848.23282986577,
      "width": 899.7327007271026,
      "height": 425,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bGw",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1563081785,
      "version": 190,
      "versionNonce": 1472158521,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1762614439699,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. SessionFactory\n\nDefinition\n\nType: org.hibernate.SessionFactory (Interface)\nImplementation: SessionFactoryImpl (Class)\n\nPurpose: Factory interface that produces Session objects\nCommunication: Creates Session → Session uses JDBC → JDBC talks to SQL Database\n\nWhat is it?\nSessionFactory is an interface that:\n->Acts as a factory to create Session interfaces\n->Heavy-weight: Expensive to create (created once per application)\n->Thread-safe: Can be shared across multiple threads\n->Singleton pattern: One instance for entire application\n->Holds database connection pool and metadata",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. SessionFactory\n\nDefinition\n\nType: org.hibernate.SessionFactory (Interface)\nImplementation: SessionFactoryImpl (Class)\n\nPurpose: Factory interface that produces Session objects\nCommunication: Creates Session → Session uses JDBC → JDBC talks to SQL Database\n\nWhat is it?\nSessionFactory is an interface that:\n->Acts as a factory to create Session interfaces\n->Heavy-weight: Expensive to create (created once per application)\n->Thread-safe: Can be shared across multiple threads\n->Singleton pattern: One instance for entire application\n->Holds database connection pool and metadata",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "X3ZWVBLCKJZm4K7fxWALY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -445.01005801915755,
      "y": 23297.65278514717,
      "width": 529.5565228505756,
      "height": 508.84200516437704,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 988853239,
      "version": 141,
      "versionNonce": 416187193,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1762614489725,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "public class HibernateUtil {\n    \n    private static SessionFactory sessionFactory;\n    \n    static {\n        try {\n            sessionFactory = new Configuration()\n                    .configure()\n                    .buildSessionFactory();\n            System.out.println(\"✅ SessionFactory created!\");\n        } catch (Exception e) {\n            e.printStackTrace();\n            throw new ExceptionInInitializerError(e);\n        }\n    }\n    \n    public static SessionFactory getSessionFactory() {\n        return sessionFactory;\n    }\n    \n    public static void shutdown() {\n        if (sessionFactory != null) {\n            sessionFactory.close();\n        }\n    }\n}",
      "fontSize": 15.656677081980824,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "public class HibernateUtil {\n    \n    private static SessionFactory sessionFactory;\n    \n    static {\n        try {\n            sessionFactory = new Configuration()\n                    .configure()\n                    .buildSessionFactory();\n            System.out.println(\"✅ SessionFactory created!\");\n        } catch (Exception e) {\n            e.printStackTrace();\n            throw new ExceptionInInitializerError(e);\n        }\n    }\n    \n    public static SessionFactory getSessionFactory() {\n        return sessionFactory;\n    }\n    \n    public static void shutdown() {\n        if (sessionFactory != null) {\n            sessionFactory.close();\n        }\n    }\n}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
